    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "enter",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "手术前，坂口推开手术室更衣室的门，顺手脱下白大褂，挂进自己的柜子。\n正准备继续换上刷手服时，他忽然察觉——更衣室深处，好像还有一个人。",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_enter",
            "label": "望向更衣室深处",
            "next": "notice",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "notice",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "长椅旁站着一名身材娇小、戴着眼镜的年轻女性。她显然也正在换衣服，手里还抓着一件尚未来得及穿上的刷手服。\n我们的视线撞在一起。",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_notice",
            "label": "她似乎也看见了我",
            "next": "scream",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "scream",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……诶？」\n她整个人猛地僵住，手里的刷手服“啪”地掉到地上。\n「诶……诶诶诶诶诶——！？医、医生！？为什么！？这里怎么会有男医生！？」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_scream",
            "label": "立刻道歉",
            "next": "cover",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "cover",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "她终于反应过来自己的处境，慌忙用双手遮住身体，脸一下红到了耳根。",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_cover",
            "label": "马上转过身",
            "next": "turn_away",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "turn_away",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「抱歉！」\n坂口立刻转过身，面向墙壁。\n「我什么都没看。至少……我现在已经转过去了。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_turn_away",
            "label": "保持背对她",
            "next": "too_late",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "too_late",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「现、现在才转过去已经完全来不及了吧……！」\n「……这点我无从反驳。」\n「呜……」\n背后传来她手忙脚乱捡起衣服的声音。",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_too_late",
            "label": "指出门牌",
            "next": "male_room",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "male_room",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「不过，这里应该是男性更衣室。」\n身后的动作突然停了。\n「对。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_male_room",
            "label": "等待她反应",
            "next": "realization",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "realization",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……男、男性？」\n短暂的沉默后，她像被门牌当头砸中。\n「对、对不起！！是我走错了！这里真的是男性更衣室！？」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_realization",
            "label": "至少今天一直如此",
            "next": "myopia",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "myopia",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「呜哇……完了……我、我是今天第一次来手术室帮忙。刚才换衣服的时候摘了眼镜，看门口的字只剩下一团……」\n「我还想说，怎么这个更衣室一个人都没有，好幸运……」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_myopia",
            "label": "看来不是幸运",
            "next": "not_lucky",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "not_lucky",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「请不要这么冷静地总结啦……！」\n她的声音已经羞得快要钻进地板。",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_not_lucky",
            "label": "让她先换好衣服",
            "next": "offer",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "offer",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「没关系。反正我已经转过来了。你先把衣服换好吧，换好了告诉我一声，我再转身。」\n「总不能让你这样跑出去吧。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_offer",
            "label": "继续面对墙壁",
            "next": "thanks",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "thanks",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……可以吗？谢谢医生。」\n「那个……请真的不要回头哦。就算听到什么奇怪的声音也不可以。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_thanks",
            "label": "答应不回头",
            "next": "odd_noise",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "odd_noise",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「你换刷手服会产生什么奇怪的声音？」\n「我、我不知道！所以才提前说嘛！」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_odd_noise",
            "label": "听见衣料声",
            "next": "fumble",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "fumble",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "身后立刻传来一阵慌乱的衣料摩擦声。\n「啊……等等……裤腿……」\n紧接着是一声轻微的撞击。\n「痛……」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_fumble",
            "label": "问她有没有事",
            "next": "concern",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "concern",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「没事！请千万不要因为担心我就转过来！」\n「明白。」\n又是一阵窸窸窣窣的声音。终于，她小声说：\n「……好了。医生，可以转过来了。」",
        "expression": "shy",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_concern",
            "label": "转过身",
            "next": "dressed",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/changing_shy.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.4,
        "portrait_right": 1220,
        "portrait_y": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "dressed",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "刚才那场混乱总算结束。她已经换好了浅绿色刷手衣和长裤，只是脸依旧红得像刚跑完一千米。那副细框眼镜重新端正地架在鼻梁上。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_dressed",
            "label": "看向换好衣服的护士",
            "next": "apology",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "apology",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……真的非常非常对不起。」\n「没什么。至少现在知道哪个更衣室不能进了。」\n「医生……请不要把它说得像学习成果一样……」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_apology",
            "label": "问她是不是第一次来手术室",
            "next": "first_shift",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "first_shift",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「是、是的。我平时主要在门诊。今天人手不够，所以第一次被安排来手术室协助。」\n「我本来还想着，一定要认真一点，千万不能给大家添麻烦……」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_first_shift",
            "label": "提起她闯进男更衣室",
            "next": "tease",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "tease",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「然后第一件事就是闯进男更衣室。」\n她沉默了两秒。\n「医生是不是其实有一点坏心眼？」\n「刚认识五分钟就发现了吗？」\n「三分钟就发现了……」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_tease",
            "label": "请她正式介绍自己",
            "next": "introduction",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "introduction",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她小声嘀咕完，又赶紧站直。\n「总、总之，正式自我介绍一下。我叫本庄萌惠，是新来的护士。」\n「平时在门诊工作，不过以后应该偶尔也会到手术室帮忙。我会努力不给医生添麻烦的。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_introduction",
            "label": "向她自我介绍",
            "next": "advice",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "advice",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「我是这里的医生。以后请多关照。不过有一件事，我建议你优先努力。」\n「是什么？」\n「进更衣室以前先戴好眼镜。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_advice",
            "label": "等待她的回答",
            "next": "promise",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "promise",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「……我会的。绝对会的。」\n她用力点头，认真得像刚接受了什么重大医疗指示。\n「那、那我先去手术室了！今天的事情……真的非常对不起！」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_promise",
            "label": "告诉她不用再道歉",
            "next": "almost_says",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "almost_says",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「可是医生看到了——」\n她忽然意识到自己差点说出什么，整张脸再次涨红。\n「没、没什么！失礼了！」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_almost_says",
            "label": "目送她逃向门口",
            "next": "doorframe",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png",
        "portrait_scale": 1.0,
        "portrait_right": 1150,
        "portrait_y": 145
      },
      {
        "id": "doorframe",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "她快步逃向门口，然后差点撞上门框。\n「啊！」\n「……本庄护士。」\n「请不要说！」\n门“砰”地关上。看来这位新护士，大概会是个相当令人放心不下的人。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_doorframe",
            "label": "记住这位迷糊的新护士",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "moe_changing_room_encountered"
